# PROGRAM 0 core: lifecycle; initialization and retries; install order;
# discovery shape rules; names; limits; statistics; rendered label rules
#
# Hand written Brainfuck in the house style of text dot bf: comments never
# hold a command character; @cell checkpoints and tilde run lengths are
# checked by tools/bftool/lint
#
# The only program with persistent cells: 0 to 63 survive between requests
# and OP RESET clears them; the runtime zeroes the scratch cells from 64 up
# before every request so no request has to clean up after itself
#
# Persistent cells
# %cell ui 0
# %cell att 1
# %cell ini 2
# %cell inz 3
# %cell atm 4 4
# %cell pc 8 2
# %cell ic 10
# %cell rt 11 4
# %cell re 15 4
# %cell rcy 19
# %cell ut 20 4
# %cell ucy 24
# %cell rf 25 4
# %cell rfc 29
# %cell pa 30
# ui: label hooks installed; att: attach guard requested; ini: initialized;
# inz: an attempt is running; atm: attempts; pc: primary boundary matches;
# ic: injector shapes; rt re rcy: removals total and events and cycle;
# ut ucy: collapses; rf rfc: replacement failures; pa: permalink ads shapes
#
# Scratch cells
# %cell maj 64
# %cell min 65
# %cell op 66
# %cell flg 67
# %cell len 68 2
# %cell id 70 2
# %cell vx 72
# %cell vy 73
# %cell g 74
# %cell o 75
# %cell fA 76
# %cell tA 77
# %cell eA 78
# %cell s 79
# %cell fB 80
# %cell tB 81
# %cell eB 82
# %cell c 83
# %cell fC 84
# %cell tC 85
# %cell eC 86
# %cell L 87 11
# %cell dflt 98
# %cell w 99
# %cell tm 100
# %cell th 101 4
# %cell tsrc 105
# %cell ttx 106
# %cell tv 107
# %cell X 108 20
#
# o is a copy of the opcode that the case switch tests; w emits constant
# bytes; tm th tsrc ttx are the arguments of a text matcher call and tv its
# verdict; L and X are free for each case
#
# A text call writes the CALL frame 1 0 96 0 11 0 0 0 then program 1;
# OP TEXT MATCH 56; flags 1 (fetch); argc 1; the matcher; the handle; the
# source and the transform; the reply is eight header bytes then the verdict

# == header
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> ~64 @maj
, > , > , > , > , > , > , > ,                                         @id:1
# == version check: vx gets maj minus 1; vy is the else flag
>> +                                                                  @vy
<<<<<<<<< ~9                                                          @maj
[- >>>>>>>> ~8 + >> + <<<<<<<<<< ~10 ]                                @maj
>>>>>>>>>> ~10                                                        @g
[- <<<<<<<<<< ~10 + >>>>>>>>>> ~10 ]                                  @g
<< -                                                                  @vx
